	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Donavit me nuper <persName ref="p8011">Rudolphus Gvalterus</persName>, vir certe in domino mirę pietatis et eruditionis, suis homili<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>is in canonicam divi Ioannis evangeliste scriptis, quo dono supra modum animum meum exhilaravit.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z3"/>Dominus rependat illi iuxta divitias gratiae sę.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Accepi item abs te Periochen, eque mihi gratum <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>donum; perge pene redivivus agere, quod hactenus fecisti, et causam Christi vivificare <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>et <persName ref="p8440">Gervasium</persName> tuum pristino amore prosequi.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">De <persName ref="p1754">Ioanne Iungio</persName>, <placeName ref="l2">Aroviensis</placeName> ecclesię ministro, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>quid acciderit, ex <persName ref="p8011">Gvaltero</persName> michi charissimo percipias.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Certe non pauci ex ministris <lb xml:id="p1z7"/><placeName ref="l41">Bernensis</placeName> ditionis insinceriter ambulant.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Cave veterem <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> ecclesię morem de <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>celebrandis synodis ulla occasione in spongiam abire permittas.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Res est profecto ecclesiis <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>perquam necessaria.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="de">Wir läbend und gruͤnend wie die dätelkolben im weyer.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Convenimus <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>bis in anno capitulatim, sed nimis frigide omnia aguntur, mutuo nudi... nulla <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>iusta adhibita lima, paulo (ut moris est) sęveriores et doctiores ridentur, deest authoritas <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>magistratus.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">prefecti hinc inde connivent in nostra vitia, ut eo illis liceat liberius nepotari.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/><foreign xml:lang="la">In summa: quemadmodum sacerdos, sic et populus,</foreign> und wo man nitt ein maal stattlich dorzu <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>thun, wirt es der tagen eynest gros unruw bringen.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Hęc tibi ut veteri amico <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>in sinum loquor.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Ego ut advena in terra hac parum proficio apud meos <placeName ref="l285">Lentzburgenses</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>quanquam nullos labores detrectem subire; usque adeo inolevit luxus et veritatis neglectus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">[Ora] <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>tu pro me dominum, ut per patientiam actionis finem perferre valeam.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, amice in<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>comparabilis, cum tota tua familia.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Date <placeName ref="l285">Lentzburgi</placeName> 12. aprilis anno 1553.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/><persName ref="p8440">Gervasius</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Ornatissimo viro <persName ref="p495">Heinricho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> ecclesię <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>fideli ministro, domino praeceptori <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>et veteri amico charissimo.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">Zurch</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
